{"parse": {"title": "灵魂影映-02", "pageid": 119377, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-01\" title=\"灵魂影映-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">灵魂影映-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-03\" title=\"灵魂影映-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">灵魂影映</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B1.86.E5.AD.90.E9.A2.84.E8.A8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"豆子预言\">豆子预言</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 豆子预言</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Fate's Bitter Beans</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-312514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-312514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-312514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>考验在这一天终于降临了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-312514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-312514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-312514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>总而言之，野树莓一世之父母，即阿诺德六世及伯爵夫人，他们暂且，暂且进入了沉眠……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……爸爸呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>天黑啦，爸爸没有回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>难道他在森林里迷了路？希望不是那样，否则，嗜血的阿诺德伯爵就要闹笑话啦～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>餐桌上，黯淡的餐盘只有三个，盛着灰黄色的豆子。母亲脸色惨白，不明所以的女孩被自己的想象逗笑，发出“咯咯”的笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>妈妈，影子、影子——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>……先吃饭吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低声道。今天没有动物影子剧场了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵剧烈的敲门声响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲立刻捂住最小的孩子的嘴，不让他因为惊吓而发出声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>野树莓……快！带着你弟弟躲起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>不要出声……千万别出声！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的话近乎只有气声，脸上的神情极度惊惧。此时，砸门的声音震耳欲聋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>尼古拉，安静……安静……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>妈、妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>尼古拉，快跟我来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女主人连脚步都在颤抖，走向门前。姐姐打开小衣橱，将更小的孩子抱进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>尼古拉，不要出声，千万不要！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最小的孩子吓得眼中溢满泪水，被关进狭小的黑暗之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有多余的时间留给她寻找藏身之所，细瘦的女孩一弯腰，钻进落满灰尘的沙发下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脆弱的门终于被完全破坏，吱呀一声，风、火药味和血腥味扑入窄小、破旧的室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>夜间巡查！屋子里都有谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>只有我一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>“平民自卫队”的人，是不是藏在这里？！老实回答！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>你们来错地方了！我并不认识他们的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙发下的女孩听见母亲发出一声尖叫。她浑身颤抖，紧紧捂住了自己的嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再也听不见母亲的声音了，取而代之的是沉重、粗鲁的步伐闯进她的家，粗暴地搜寻、打砸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张陌生的脸突然探到沙发下。所幸屋内昏暗，瘦小的她藏在阴影之中，一时竟没有被发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个因为食物匮乏而身形细瘦的孩子躲在过分狭窄的空间里，躲过搜寻，也因此逃过一劫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>没有，让那个混账逃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>该死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声已经接近门口。这时，斑驳掉漆的小衣橱里却传来突兀的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>……嗝！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从不抱怨餐盘中豆子的乏味和重复，小尼古拉听话地全部吃掉，这种乖巧竟在此刻致命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>什么声音？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>屋子里还有人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步快速折返回屋内，靠近声音的来源。小衣橱被打开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>……啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>妈、妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>一个孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>他的儿子……错不了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>把他抓起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-638210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-638210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-638210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小尼古拉被从窄小的衣橱中粗暴地拖了出去，躲在沙发下的女孩目睹了这一切，极度的恐惧让她动弹不得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">妈妈……小尼古拉……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门彻底关上了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一天后，由平民组成的自卫队与驻军在当地发生冲突，自卫队死伤惨重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个以为可以和家人团聚的孩子，目光呆滞地、趔趔趄趄地穿过满地尸体。她的父母正远远地跪在枪口之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>野树莓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-638213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-638213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-638213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵将母亲按倒了，女孩以为母亲正在呼唤她，脚步越来越快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>野树莓……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>跑啊——野树莓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈……我不要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>快跑啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的眼睛像两个深深的黑洞，她脸上的肌肉扭曲着，濒死的叫吼让她变得十分陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩止住了脚步。她向来不如小尼古拉乖巧，但母亲这次的神情实在过于惊惧，让她的身体先于理智做出反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她后退了几步，转身踉踉跄跄地跑了起来。枪打在地上溅起浓浓的尘屑，随后又是一声巨响。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸……妈妈……小尼古拉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我该怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>城镇燃起硝烟，天空中有雨和炮弹一起落下来。土地泥泞，巨响盖住了哭泣和惨叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她找到了小尼古拉。小尼古拉已在交战的轰炸中失去了双腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐……对不起……我走不动了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉！我背你……没关系，我背着你，我们一起去找爸爸妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐，我好痛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我带你回家，小尼古拉，不要睡！和我说话，小尼古拉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>背起比以往更加安静的弟弟，她穿过被血染得泥泞的土地，寻找父母，寻求庇护。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弟弟不知何时变得沉默，不再哭诉他的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎睡着过，极度的不安和饥饿又让她很快惊醒，用雨水与野果充饥。灰色的硝烟已被雨水浇熄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑夜中，她背着安静的弟弟，迈着伤痕累累的双腿，走上回家的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸，妈妈，你们在哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉，醒一醒，不要再睡了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>今晚不吃煮豆子好不好？唔，可以多要一点土豆……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她恍惚地行走在昏暗的街道，空气之中有燃烧过的灰烬和铁锈味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩一边自言自语着，仔仔细细地端详沉睡在肮脏街道上的一具具身体，辨认他们的脸庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她回到自己逃跑的地方，到处是睡着的人们，一个十分瘦弱的老人拉着板车，将一具具身体叠到车上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉……先放你下来好吗？我去找爸爸妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>你这样一直睡，妈妈看到了一定会说你的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>孩子，他已经……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>对不起，爷爷——尼古拉！好吧，我要放你下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的身体像石头一样沉，僵硬地顺着她的手臂滑下去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>听话一些，小尼古拉，在这里等我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音戛然而止，目光已从板车落到地上，她看到父母正并肩熟睡在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>……这也是你的家人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>是爸爸、妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>节哀吧，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>为什么要节哀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩抛出呆滞的问句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>他们全都死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>死灰色的脸孔，对任何声响都再无反应的身体说明了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>没有死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>他们只是睡着了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩毫无血色的嘴唇开合着，无法接受眼前的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她俯下身去，伤痕累累的手一一抚摸过他们脏污、冰冷的面庞，一一整理他们残破的衣服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸妈妈只是和小尼古拉一样，他们都睡着了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雨又落了下来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "灵魂影映-02"}}